# 🏨 Hotel Automation Software

A full-stack web application for hotel room reservation, billing, catering, and guest/admin management.

---

## 🔧 Backend (Flask)

### 📂 Structure
```
hotel-automation/
├── backend/
│   ├── app.py
│   ├── models.py
│   ├── db_config.py
│   ├── auth.py
│   ├── routes/
│   │   ├── guest.py
│   │   ├── admin.py
│   │   ├── billing.py
│   │   ├── reservation.py
│   │   └── catering.py
│   └── utils/
│       ├── pdf_generator.py
│       └── auth_utils.py
├── tests/
│   └── test_all.py
├── requirements.txt
```

### 🚀 Setup
```bash
cd hotel-automation
python -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate  # On Windows: venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Create MySQL DB `hotel_automation`, then run:
```python
from backend import db_config
app = db_config.create_app()
with app.app_context():
    from backend import models
    models.db.create_all()
```

---

## 🌐 Frontend (React + Tailwind)

### 📂 Structure
```
frontend/
├── public/
├── src/
│   ├── index.js
│   ├── App.js
│   └── pages/
│       ├── LoginPage.js
│       ├── GuestDashboard.js
│       ├── AdminDashboard.js
│       ├── RoomReservationPage.js
│       ├── BillViewPage.js
│       └── FoodOrderPage.js
├── package.json
```

### 🚀 Setup
```bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```

---

## ✅ Features
- Guest registration & login
- Admin login (manual creation in DB)
- Room reservation
- Food ordering
- Billing & PDF export
- Admin dashboard (view guests, rooms, orders)
- Unit tests using PyTest

---

## 🔐 Admin Creation Example
```sql
INSERT INTO Admin (name, username, password) VALUES ('Admin', 'admin', '<hashed_password>');
```
Use Python to hash password:
```python
from werkzeug.security import generate_password_hash
print(generate_password_hash("yourpassword"))
```
